  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_0114.jpg\" style=\"width: 478px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El obispo de la di&oacute;cesis Segorbe-Castell&oacute;n, Casimiro L&oacute;pez Llorente, ha inaugurado a mediod&iacute;a de este domingo, tras la misa,&nbsp;la remodelaci&oacute;n de la casa abad&iacute;a de la parroqu&iacute;a de la Asunci&oacute;n de Onda, que ha reabierto sus puertas en la plaza de la Sinagoga. Todas las fotos de este reportaje son de FERNANDO MIRALLES PIQUER.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0002.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0011.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0012.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0013.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0014.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0015.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0016.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/misainauguracioncasaabadiaonda/dsc_0017.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4